Package: koinos-bsp-spacemit-k3
Architecture: all
Multi-Arch: foreign
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, linux-image-riscv64, koinos-hwcaps, koinos-hwcaps-ifunc
Recommends: koinos-bsp-spacemit-k3-firmware, koinos-bsp-spacemit-k3-npu
Description: Agile611 Koinos RISC-V BSP for SpacemiT K3 (Pico-ITX, CoM260 TQ, K3 AI Book)
 This package provides Board Support Package for SpacemiT K3 SoC
 (X100 + A100, RVA23 profile) used in Pico-ITX, CoM260 TQ, K3 AI Book,
 DeepComputing Mainboard III, and C2201 dual-socket server.
 .
 Includes:
  * Kernel modules for K3 peripherals (X100 + A100, RVA23)
  * Device Tree overlays for Pico-ITX, CoM260 TQ, K3 AI Book
  * PMIC variant overlays (Variant A/B for CoM260 TQ)
  * LPDDR5 memory configuration
  * UFS storage support (CoM260 TQ)
  * NPU driver support (16 TOPS A100)
  * RVV 1.0 vector acceleration via hwcaps/IFUNC
  * PCIe Gen 4 configuration
  * LPDDR5 memory configuration
  * UFS storage support
  * Thermal zone configuration
 .
 This is an RVA23-capable SoC with full RVV 1.0 vector acceleration support.

Package: koinos-bsp-spacemit-k3-firmware
Architecture: all
Multi-Arch: foreign
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, koinos-bsp-spacemit-k3
Description: Agile611 Koinos RISC-V BSP for SpacemiT K3 - Firmware blobs
 This package provides firmware blobs for K3 peripherals
 including PMIC, LPDDR5 PHY, UFS, and NPU firmware.
 .
 Note: Some firmware may require separate download due to licensing.

Package: koinos-bsp-spacemit-k3-npu
Architecture: all
Multi-Arch: foreign
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, koinos-bsp-spacemit-k3
Description: Agile611 Koinos RISC-V BSP for SpacemiT K3 - NPU support (16 TOPS A100)
 This package provides NPU driver and runtime for A100 NPU
 in SpacemiT K3 SoC (16 TOPS INT8).
 .
 Note: Requires proprietary NPU firmware and SDK.
